<h1 data-l="1-1" id="nesting">Nesting</h1>
<blockquote data-l="3-14">
<p data-l="3-3">A quote with a list:</p>
<ul data-l="5-7">
<li data-l="5-7">item with <code>code</code> and a <a href="https://x.y">link</a>
<ol data-l="6-7">
<li data-l="6-7">nested ordered inside a bullet inside a quote</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ul>
<pre data-l="8-10"><code class="language-js">fenced(&quot;in a quote&quot;);
</code></pre>
<table data-l="12-14">
<thead data-l="12-12">
<tr data-l="12-12"><th data-l="12-12">in</th><th data-l="12-12">quote</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody data-l="14-14">
<tr data-l="14-14"><td data-l="14-14">1</td><td data-l="14-14">2</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</blockquote>
<ol data-l="16-28">
<li data-l="16-20"><p data-l="16-16">Ordered with a table:</p>
<table data-l="18-20">
<thead data-l="18-18">
<tr data-l="18-18"><th data-l="18-18">a</th><th data-l="18-18">b</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody data-l="20-20">
<tr data-l="20-20"><td data-l="20-20">c</td><td data-l="20-20">d</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</li>
<li data-l="22-24"><p data-l="22-22">Ordered with a heading (allowed by CommonMark):</p>
<h2 data-l="24-24" id="heading-in-a-list-item">Heading in a list item</h2>
</li>
<li data-l="26-28"><p data-l="26-26">Ordered with a task list:</p>
<ul data-l="27-28">
<li data-l="27-27"><input type="checkbox" checked disabled> done</li>
<li data-l="28-28"><input type="checkbox" disabled> open</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<ul data-l="30-40">
<li data-l="30-32">Bullet with a blockquote:
<blockquote data-l="31-32">
<p data-l="31-32">quoted inside a bullet
with <strong>strong</strong></p>
</blockquote>
</li>
<li data-l="33-36">Bullet with a math block:
<math data-l="34-36" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>
</li>
<li data-l="37-40">Bullet with a mermaid fence:
<pre data-l="38-40" class="mermaid">graph LR; A--&gt;B;
</pre>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-l="42-42">Trailing paragraph.</p>
